  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SKL International - F&#xf6;rstudie om decentralisering i DRC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SKL International - PreStudy on decentralisation in DRC - SKL International - Pre-study on decentralisation in the DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SKL International har ans&#xf6;kt till Sveriges ambassad i Kinshasa f&#xf6;r att finansiera en f&#xf6;rstudie i Demokratiska republiken Kongo (DRC) f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka deras f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;else f&#xf6;r decentraliseringsprocessen, det politiska landskapet mellan provinsiell f&#xf6;rvaltning och centralregering, f&#xf6;r att identifiera  m&#xf6;jligheter f&#xf6;r Sverige och kontextualisera sina tidigare erfarenheter och drar slutsatser f&#xf6;r framtida insatser.

F&#xf6;rstudien f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas ta sex m&#xe5;nader och den totala budgeten, inklusive programchef, personal och controller samt tv&#xe5; m&#xe5;naders uppdrag i DRC, &#xe4;r 2 575 800 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SKL International has applied to the Embassy of Sweden in Kinshasa for funding a pre-study in the Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC) to increase their understanding on decentralization process, the policy landscape between provincial administrative governance and central government, identify possible opportunity for Sweden to add it values and contextualize their previous experiences and draw conclusions for future interventions to support the fragile devolvement. 

The pre-study is expected to take six months and the total budget, including programme manager, staff and controller as well as two-month long mission in DRC, is 2 575 800 SEK.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the pre-study is to provide an analytical and situational overview of the current situation in the DRC in terms of the decentralization process and local self-governance as well as to propose and describe suitable interventions for a programme in support of decentralization efforts in the DRC from 2021 and onwards.

The pre-study shall enquire the ideas of interventions to i) support provincial State institutions to strengthen their administration; ii) support administration governance programme ; and iii) identify opportunity and interest in pushing for reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
